#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:2
msgid "Manage your plugin preferences"
msgstr "플러그인 환경설정 관리"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:4
msgid ""
"Using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app, you can customize "
"Mattermost plugin preferences for Microsoft Teams and Calls by selecting "
"**Settings** |gear| next to your profile picture."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때 프로필 사진 옆의 "
"**설정** |gear|\\ 을 선택해 Microsoft Teams 및 통화용 OKR.BEST 플러그인 "
"환경설정을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
msgstr "설정 아이콘을 사용해 OKR.BEST 사용자 경험을 사용자 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:7
msgid "Microsoft Teams plugin preferences"
msgstr "Microsoft Teams 플러그인 환경설정"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Enterprise, and Enterprise "
"Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ (not available on "
"Professional)"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced 플랜 "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다 "
"(Professional에서는 제공되지 않음)"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select **MS Teams** to connect your Mattermost and Microsoft Teams "
"accounts, and manage notification preferences for Microsoft Teams chats "
"and group chats. See the :ref:`connect your account <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-teams:connect "
"your mattermost account to your microsoft teams account>`."
msgstr ""
"**MS Teams**\\ 를 선택해 OKR.BEST와 Microsoft Teams 계정을 연결하고, Microsoft "
"Teams 채팅과 그룹 채팅에 대한 알림 환경설정을 관리합니다. :ref:`계정 연결 "
"<end-user-guide/collaborate/collaborate-within-connected-microsoft-"
"teams:connect your mattermost account to your microsoft teams account>`\\ 을 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:16
msgid ""
"Download our `Mattermost for Microsoft Teams datasheet "
"<https://mattermost.com/mattermost-for-microsoft-teams-datasheet/>`_ to "
"learn how Mattermost helps your organization get more from your Microsoft"
" tools."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost for Microsoft Teams 데이터시트 <https://mattermost.com"
"/mattermost-for-microsoft-teams-datasheet/>`_\\ 를 다운로드하여 OKR.BEST가 "
"조직이 Microsoft 도구를 더 잘 활용하도록 어떻게 돕는지 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:19
msgid "Calls plugin preferences"
msgstr "통화 플러그인 환경설정"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **Calls** to specify the audio devices, including micrphone and "
"speaker, used for Mattermost calls."
msgstr ""
"**Calls**\\ 를 선택해 OKR.BEST 통화에 사용할 마이크와 스피커 등 오디오 장치를 "
"지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-preferences.rst:28
msgid ""
"Download our `Mattermost Calls datasheet <https://mattermost.com"
"/mattermost-calls-datasheet/>`_ to learn how Calls make it easy for teams"
" to adapt their communication to a wider variety of situations."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Calls 데이터시트 <https://mattermost.com/mattermost-calls-"
"datasheet/>`_\\ 를 다운로드하여 통화가 팀이 더 다양한 상황에 맞춰 손쉽게 "
"소통하도록 어떻게 돕는지 알아보세요."

